        "text_83rbDx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Blue sapphires</strong>, known for their deep and mesmerizing shades, range from light sky blue to rich, velvety navy. These timeless gems are perfect for creating jewelry that exudes elegance and sophistication.<br/><a href=\"/collections/blue-sapphire\" title=\"Blue Sapphire\">Discover the beauty of blue sapphire jewelry</a></p><p><strong>Brown sapphires</strong> offer warm, earthy tones from light champagne to deep coffee, providing a versatile beauty that suits both modern and classic designs. <br/><a href=\"/collections/brown-sapphires\" title=\"Brown sapphires\">Discover our brown sapphire jewelry now</a></p><p><strong>Pink sapphires</strong>, with their soft and romantic hues, range from pastel pinks to vibrant magentas, adding a playful elegance to any jewelry piece.<br/> <a href=\"/collections/pink-sapphire\" title=\"Pink Sapphire\">Find your perfect pink sapphire today</a></p><p><strong>Green sapphires</strong> capture nature’s essence with shades from soft moss to deep forest green, offering a distinct, earthy elegance.<a href=\"/collections/green-sapphire\" title=\"green sapphire\"> Explore our green sapphire jewelry</a></p><p><strong>Grey sapphires</strong>, with their misty hues from silver to smoky charcoal, add a modern, sophisticated edge to any look. <a href=\"/collections/grey-sapphire\" title=\"Grey sapphire\">Elevate your style with grey sapphire pieces now</a></p><p>Each sapphire color has its own unique story and aesthetic, allowing you to find the perfect gemstone to reflect your personal style and taste.</p>",
            "text_style": "subtitle"
